<title>NETHERLANDS: Vendex 96/97 net profit NLG 539 mln.</title>
<headline>Vendex 96/97 net profit NLG 539 mln.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996/97 to Jan 31</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     6.70 vs   4.94</p>
<p>    Net profit				539 vs 415</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  2.00 vs   1.50</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		 12.15 vs  11.26</p>
<p>    Operating profit			473 vs 412</p>
<p>    Op. profit excl. real estate	362 vs 286</p>
<p>    Interest charges			 60 vs  63</p>
<p>    Tax					  41 vs  24</p>
<p>    Revalutions/gains		     151 vs  50</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected retail and business services group Vendex International NV to report a net profit of around 540 million guilders. They had forecast operating profit excluding income from redevelopment and the sale of property at 373 million guilders.  </p>
<p>Vendex said operating profit included 111 million guilders from the sale and the redevelopment of property versus 126 million in 1995/96.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
